</section>

<!-- ═══════ LAYOUT ═══════ -->
<div class="sc-legal sc-legal-layout">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <aside class="sc-legal-sidebar">
    <p class="sc-legal-sidebar__label">Contents</p>
    <ul class="sc-legal-sidebar__nav">
      <li><a href="#war-overview"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">00</span>Overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-acl"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">01</span>Statutory Guarantees</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-tiers"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">02</span>Warranty Periods</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-exclusions"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">03</span>Exclusions</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-protocol"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">04</span>Diagnostic Protocol</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-logistics"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">05</span>Logistics &amp; Costs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#war-support"><span class="sc-legal-sidebar__num">06</span>Local Support</a></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>

  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <div class="sc-legal-content">

    <!-- 00 OVERVIEW -->
    <section class="sc-legal-sec" id="war-overview">
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__head">
        <span class="sc-legal-sec__num">00</span>
        <div class="sc-legal-sec__line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="sc-legal-sec__title">Overview</h2>
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__text">
        <p>Welcome to Sensol Fitness (<strong>sensolfitness.com.au</strong>). We stand behind the professional engineering, durability, and commercial-grade quality of our smart fitness equipment. Our warranty policy is straightforward and designed to fully comply with the Australian Consumer Law (ACL) under the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 01 ACL -->
    <section class="sc-legal-sec" id="war-acl">
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__head">
        <span class="sc-legal-sec__num">01</span>
        <div class="sc-legal-sec__line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="sc-legal-sec__title">Statutory Consumer Guarantees (ACL)</h2>
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__text">
        <p>Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage. You are also entitled to have the goods repaired or replaced if the goods fail to be of acceptable quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure.</p>
        <div class="sc-legal-callout">
          <p class="sc-legal-callout__label">Important</p>
          <p class="sc-legal-callout__text">The commercial warranties outlined in Section 2 are <strong>in addition to</strong>, and do not limit or override, your statutory rights under the ACL.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 TIERS -->
    <section class="sc-legal-sec" id="war-tiers">
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__head">
        <span class="sc-legal-sec__num">02</span>
        <div class="sc-legal-sec__line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="sc-legal-sec__title">Sensol Fitness Tiered Warranty Periods</h2>
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__text">
        <p>We provide a voluntary Limited Commercial Warranty to the original purchaser for domestic, non-commercial home use, commencing from the official date of delivery recorded by our logistics partners:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-warranty-tiers">
        <div class="sc-warranty-tier">
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__name">Structural Frame</span>
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__period">5<span class="sc-warranty-tier__period-unit">Years</span></span>
          <p class="sc-warranty-tier__desc">Covers structural <strong>steel welds, chassis integrity</strong>, and heavy-duty frame casting. Excludes cosmetic surface scratches or paint finish degradation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-warranty-tier">
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__name">Electric Motor &amp; Digital Resistance</span>
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__period">2<span class="sc-warranty-tier__period-unit">Years</span></span>
          <p class="sc-warranty-tier__desc">Covers the internal <strong>heavy-duty electric motor drive units</strong> and magnetic/digital resistance actuators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-warranty-tier">
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__name">Touchscreen Console &amp; Electronics</span>
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__period">1<span class="sc-warranty-tier__period-unit">Year</span></span>
          <p class="sc-warranty-tier__desc">Covers the electronic <strong>console, internal PCB mainboards</strong>, connection wiring, and advanced sensory components.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sc-warranty-tier">
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__name">High-Wear Components</span>
          <span class="sc-warranty-tier__period">6<span class="sc-warranty-tier__period-unit">Months</span></span>
          <p class="sc-warranty-tier__desc">Covers quick-wear accessories, including <strong>grips, resistance straps, pull cables</strong>, and soft-touch upholstery padding.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-legal-note">This warranty is strictly <strong>non-transferable</strong> and applies exclusively to the original buyer registered within our Shopify sales database.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 EXCLUSIONS -->
    <section class="sc-legal-sec" id="war-exclusions">
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__head">
        <span class="sc-legal-sec__num">03</span>
        <div class="sc-legal-sec__line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="sc-legal-sec__title">Specific Warranty Exclusions</h2>
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__text">
        <p>This commercial warranty strictly does not apply to any damage, malfunction, or failure resulting from:</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="sc-warranty-exclusions">
        <li>
          <strong>Improper Self-Assembly</strong>
          Failure to assemble, calibrate, or wire the unit in strict accordance with the official Sensol Fitness user manual.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Commercial Exploitation</strong>
          Operation of domestic-grade equipment within commercial fitness studios, corporate gyms, cross-fit centers, or rehabilitation clinics.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Environmental &amp; Moisture Damage</strong>
          Storing or operating the machinery in uninsulated garages, outdoor patios, or damp environments prone to humidity, causing rust, structural corrosion, or water ingress.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Electrical Grid Fluctuations</strong>
          Terminal damage to PCB motherboards or digital motors caused by power grid surges, unstable voltage inputs, or failure to utilize an approved surge protector.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 PROTOCOL -->
    <section class="sc-legal-sec" id="war-protocol">
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__head">
        <span class="sc-legal-sec__num">04</span>
        <div class="sc-legal-sec__line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="sc-legal-sec__title">Heavy Freight Warranty &amp; Diagnostic Protocol</h2>
      <div class="sc-legal-sec__text">
        <p>Because our smart fitness units consist of heavy and oversized equipment weighing between <strong>28kg and 52kg+</strong>, returning products for service incurs critical heavy-logistics overheads. To ensure speed of resolution and protect against unnecessary shipping, we enforce a strict multi-tier technical protocol:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-warranty-steps">
